              Recent Market Movers
            </p>
            <h2 className="mt-3 text-3xl font-black text-white">
              Top Portfolio Movers
            </h2>
            <p className="mt-2 text-sm text-zinc-400">
              Based on the two most recent value-history snapshots. Fresh movement appears when a record value changes by at least $1.
